WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.818 --> 00:00:24.284
"Where is Mr. Grill?" Jeb asked.

2
00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:28.151
"He said to meet here."

3
00:00:28.152 --> 00:00:33.784
"Maybe he forgot," Poppy said.

4
00:00:33.785 --> 00:00:39.205
"I don't think so," Dipper said.

5
00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:44.684
Everyone looked around.

6
00:00:44.685 --> 00:00:54.571
But they didn't see the teacher.

7
00:00:54.572 --> 00:00:57.536
"Hey!" Gasser said.

8
00:00:57.537 --> 00:01:02.297
"What's this?"

9
00:01:02.298 --> 00:01:04.868
Eddy saw a sheet of paper.

10
00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:09.310
There was an oval on it.

11
00:01:09.311 --> 00:01:17.830
"Hmm," Eddy said.

12
00:01:17.831 --> 00:01:20.461
"It looks like a racetrack."

13
00:01:20.462 --> 00:01:23.274
Poppy gasped.

14
00:01:23.275 --> 00:01:27.307
"I bet Mr. Grill left it!" she said.

15
00:01:27.308 --> 00:01:30.676
Everyone looked confused.

16
00:01:30.677 --> 00:01:34.178
"Why did he leave it?" Zippy asked.

17
00:01:34.179 --> 00:01:38.147
"So we can find him," Poppy said.

18
00:01:38.148 --> 00:01:42.475
"I think it's a clue."

19
00:01:42.476 --> 00:01:45.541
"Oh, fun!" Dipper said.

20
00:01:45.542 --> 00:01:48.702
"Let's go to the racetrack!"

21
00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:53.327
Everyone hurried to the racetrack.

22
00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:57.320
Eddy saw a sign.

23
00:01:57.321 --> 00:02:08.200
It said, "Race!"
